{"3998040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fossilfuel 3", "steam_appid": 3998040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The most legendary dinosaur FPS lineup ever.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/3b65dda1b48354aa0001b2d54874d9a6.poster.avif?t=1785856638\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/3b65dda1b48354aa0001b2d54874d9a6.webm?t=1785856638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/3b65dda1b48354aa0001b2d54874d9a6.mp4?t=1785856638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped on a snowy island teeming with dinosaurs off the coast of Siberia, you must run, fight, or hide from a massive lineup of unique dinosaurs, from <strong>Terror Birds</strong> to <strong>Baryonyx</strong>, using a huge range of <strong>big guns</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;We're not alone on this island.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/f02da9b8455e33829c86388f00a16d10.poster.avif?t=1785856638\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/f02da9b8455e33829c86388f00a16d10.webm?t=1785856638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/f02da9b8455e33829c86388f00a16d10.mp4?t=1785856638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island offers open-world gameplay, your mission is to kill the evil <strong>Commodore</strong> who calls the island his home. Ambush his mercenary convoys, hide from dinosaurs, and spark clashes between NPC factions in epic three-way battles. Solve puzzles, uncover new secrets, and blast down dinosaurs in gory fashion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>History doesn't repeat, but it often rhymes. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include a full-length<strong> campaign</strong>, <strong>Horde Mode</strong>, and <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong>, plus <strong>New Game+</strong> that remixes the main campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jurassic problems. Modern firepower.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love dinosaurs and <strong>action horror</strong>, this game is for you! Don’t miss out, <strong>Wishlist now</strong>!<br><br><i>Fossilfuel 3 is the largest Fossilfuel game yet, featuring a standalone story that continues the events of Fossilfuel 2 while allowing new players to jump in without playing the previous games. Full completion is estimated at six to nine hours of gameplay.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The most legendary dinosaur FPS lineup ever.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/3b65dda1b48354aa0001b2d54874d9a6.poster.avif?t=1785856638\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/3b65dda1b48354aa0001b2d54874d9a6.webm?t=1785856638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/3b65dda1b48354aa0001b2d54874d9a6.mp4?t=1785856638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped on a snowy island teeming with dinosaurs off the coast of Siberia, you must run, fight, or hide from a massive lineup of unique dinosaurs, from <strong>Terror Birds</strong> to <strong>Baryonyx</strong>, using a huge range of <strong>big guns</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;We're not alone on this island.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/f02da9b8455e33829c86388f00a16d10.poster.avif?t=1785856638\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/f02da9b8455e33829c86388f00a16d10.webm?t=1785856638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/extras/f02da9b8455e33829c86388f00a16d10.mp4?t=1785856638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island offers open-world gameplay, your mission is to kill the evil <strong>Commodore</strong> who calls the island his home. Ambush his mercenary convoys, hide from dinosaurs, and spark clashes between NPC factions in epic three-way battles. Solve puzzles, uncover new secrets, and blast down dinosaurs in gory fashion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>History doesn't repeat, but it often rhymes. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include a full-length<strong> campaign</strong>, <strong>Horde Mode</strong>, and <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong>, plus <strong>New Game+</strong> that remixes the main campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jurassic problems. Modern firepower.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love dinosaurs and <strong>action horror</strong>, this game is for you! Don’t miss out, <strong>Wishlist now</strong>!<br><br><i>Fossilfuel 3 is the largest Fossilfuel game yet, featuring a standalone story that continues the events of Fossilfuel 2 while allowing new players to jump in without playing the previous games. Full completion is estimated at six to nine hours of gameplay.</i></p>", "short_description": "Navigate an open-world Siberian island overrun by dinosaurs. They brought them back, you’re here to put them down for good in the terrifying third act of the Fossilfuel series!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/b349ca7c3ac6ca0f88c5d255f3517662c67a99f8/header.jpg?t=1785856638", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/73c0de38c8dc45fbe967735b459b770be6fe8013/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785856638", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998040/73c0de38c8dc45fbe967735b459b770be6fe8013/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785856638", "website": "https://dangerousbobstudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 3070 or AMD 6700xt<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game includes graphics settings to aid lower end devices.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},